# Turbulent Fen: "This land enters tapped unless your opponents control eight or more lands." On turn 15 Bot2 has
# seven Forests and Ornithopter, so it controls eight permanents but only seven lands: land is one of the card types
# (CR 205.2a), so Fen enters tapped. A count of every permanent would see eight and leave it untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp x7
Turbulent Fen
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x7
Ornithopter
Forest x12

